      "value": "@{5a6c4d4edb821e1569d46de3|full_name}: Exactly!  I think it'd be cute to see little people trying to climb me!  I know there's a thing called Sizebox that is also Unity based that allows climbing of models, even models scaled up to 16 km tall!  and complete collision of the model, even down to whiskers (should your character have them)\n\nwould like to have something similar in VRC.  Only.. I'd request a way to brush them off if they go places they shouldn't",
